  message: "Overload step: a stub merged from several call sites keeps the argument_count of its first site (Java worker: argument_count 2 with call_lines [341, 343], where line 343 writes one argument). For Java the linkers run before that merge and the binds are right; for Kotlin the stubs of one name from one caller collapse BEFORE the linkers (this item), so the second call is narrowed by the first call's count as well as losing its receiver type. Evidence: ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/overloads_11252026/java_RESULTS.md (what the shared layer lacks, 4)."  # 0e95
